            "reviewBody": "We love this dip! I used one cup of mayo and eliminated the sour creme. I also added one can of RO-TEL chopped tomatoes and chilies and some cayanne pepper.\n\nAnd, try using Table/Water crackers with the dip. An amazing combination!",
