            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah A"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love this dish! I've made it at least three times- it's super easy and everyone loves it! A couple of things I've done: 1. Added fresh spinach before baking (makes me feel healthier!) 2. Served with bruschetta sauce (fantastic accoutrement, especially if you have toasted banquette!)\nOverall I love this app and will make it a go to anytime I need to bring a snack!",
